<title>USA: US FAX to sell Superior Tek assets.</title>
<headline>US FAX to sell Superior Tek assets.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>US FAX Inc has agreed to sell the assets of its Superior Tek Inc subsidiary to Future Success Software Corp, a holographic applications company.</p>
<p>The company has not disclosed specific terms of the agreement, but US FAX will receive shares of Future Success stock as payment for the SuperTek assets.</p>
<p>The stock received in the transaction will be distributed to US FAX shareholders after the completion of the transaction, the company said.</p>
</text>
